# src/composables/useHtmlSanitizer.ts writes its URL control-character class
# (stripUrlControlChars — the defence against "java\nscript:" URLs) with LITERAL
# control bytes instead of escapes. One of them is a NUL, which trips git's
# binary heuristic, so every diff of the most security-critical file in the
# repo rendered as "Binary files differ" — a change to the sanitizer could pass
# review unseen. Force a textual diff for source files.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.vue diff
*.js diff
*.mjs diff
